      "message": "fix(adaptive): bound the growth planner by the geometry it works, not only path length\n\nThe #13 budget counts revolution length, but the planner's time is\nwhole-ring polygon work per trial step: the island fixture ran ~53 s\n(release) before the length budget refused it. A third budget law now\ncounts the polygon vertices every trial step and revolution runs\nthrough (deterministic, never a wall clock); past 500 k the plan is\nrefused by name and the trochoid / Offset-ring fallback stays named.\nEvery fixture that grows today spends at most half of it (slot 252 k,\nchannel 175 k); the island is refused after 88 revolutions, 19 s\nrelease / 39 s debug for the whole pocket.\n\nFixes #850\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
